### Styling with Tailwind CSS

#### Navigation Styling Patterns
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Consistent navigation styling
const StyledNavigation = () => (
    <NavigationMenu className="bg-white shadow-sm border-b">
        <NavigationMenu.Item 
            href="/dashboard"
            className="px-4 py-2 text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-50 
                       transition-colors duration-200"
        >
            Dashboard
        </NavigationMenu.Item>
    </NavigationMenu>
);
```

#### Tab Styling Patterns
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Consistent tab styling
const StyledTabs = () => (
    <Tabs defaultValue="overview">
        <Tabs.List className="flex space-x-1 bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded-lg">
            <Tabs.Trigger 
                value="overview"
                className="px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900
                           data-[state=active]:bg-white data-[state=active]:text-blue-600
                           data-[state=active]:shadow-sm transition-all duration-200"
            >
                Overview
            </Tabs.Trigger>
        </Tabs.List>
    </Tabs>
);
```

### Accessibility Features

#### Automatic Accessibility
- **Base UI handles ARIA attributes** automatically for navigation
- **Keyboard navigation** built into all navigation components
- **Screen reader support** for all navigation elements
- **Focus management** handled by components

#### Custom Accessibility
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Maintain accessibility when customizing
const AccessibleNavigation = () => (
    <NavigationMenu aria-label="Main navigation">
        <NavigationMenu.Item 
            href="/characters"
            aria-current={isCurrentPage ? 'page' : undefined}
        >
            Characters
        </NavigationMenu.Item>
    </NavigationMenu>
);
```

